# Vigil — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env for local development:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# For Streamlit Cloud deployment, add these as Secrets in the dashboard
# (Settings → Secrets), NOT as a committed .env file.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# AI/ML API — powers all 8 Vigil agents (OpenAI-compatible endpoint)
# Get your key at: https://aimlapi.com
AIML_API_KEY=your-aiml-api-key-here

# NewsAPI.org — live financial headlines (free tier: 100 req/day)
# Get your key at: https://newsapi.org/register
NEWSAPI_KEY=your-newsapi-org-key-here

# yfinance — NO API KEY REQUIRED
# Uses Yahoo Finance public feeds directly via the yfinance Python package.
